  "_id": "tg-sheep",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Abel was a keeper of sheep, Gen. 4:2 (Moses 5:17). congregation … be not as sheep, Num. 27:17. Israel scattered … as sheep, 1 Kgs. 22:17 (2 Chr. 18:16). we are counted as sheep for the slaughter, Ps. 44:22 (Rom. 8:36). made his own people to go forth like sheep, Ps. 78:52. we are the people of his pasture, and the sheep of his hand, Ps. 95:7 (100:3). gone astray like a lost sheep, Ps. 119:176 (Isa. 53:6; 1 Pet. 2:25; Mosiah 14:6; Alma 5:37). sheep before her shearers is dumb, Isa. 53:6–7 (Mosiah 14:6–7; 15:6). My sheep wandered through all the mountains, Ezek. 34:6. as a young lion among the flocks of sheep, Micah 5:8. smite the shepherd, and the sheep shall be scattered, Zech. 13:7 (Matt. 26:31; Mark 14:27).",
